WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:06.029
It's rare for the SCP Foundation to encounter
an anomaly that volunteers information about

00:00:06.029 --> 00:00:13.430
itself, that seems to actively desire to be
studied, to be investigated, to be known.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.379
But SCP-082 is one such anomaly.

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:22.600
SCP-082 calls himself Fernand, a giant man
with an even bigger appetite, and though he

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:28.540
is cheerful and chatty, even friendly by SCP
Foundation standards, it can be difficult

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.860
to sort the fact from the fiction where his
life story is concerned.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:38.320
At various points in his containment, he has
claimed to be a vampire, a homunculus, Sherlock

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:44.910
Holmes, Alexander the Great, Dr. Frankenstein
and his Monster, Napoleon, and Big Bird, to

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.110
name a few.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:52.730
But on October 27, 2016, Fernand made a particular,
unusual request.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:57.190
He asked for a set of poetry books, a stack
of blank paper, and a quill.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:03.350
He isolated himself for days, refusing to
eat, drink, or sleep as he wrote page after

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:04.350
page.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:08.730
When he was finished, he had written a poem
that seemed to be the first honest exploration

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:12.220
of his life story since he was first contained
by the Foundation.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:17.909
It can be difficult to determine when SCP-082
is lying, since he is always grinning widely

00:01:17.909 --> 00:01:23.070
and claims to only lie when it is "through
his teeth," but after reading the aforementioned

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:28.960
poem aloud, he wept openly in what seemed
to be a genuine display of emotion.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.549
According to the events described in the poem,
which should still be taken with a small grain

00:01:33.549 --> 00:01:39.299
of salt, this is what Fernand's life was like
before he became SCP-082.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:45.240
Fernand could not remember his earliest years,
what his parents or his childhood home might

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.240
have looked like.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:51.600
His earliest memory was of a makeshift home
in an alleyway, a box to sleep in, and a bundle

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:54.219
of rags serving as a makeshift bed.

00:01:54.219 --> 00:01:59.009
For food, he would steal day-old bread thrown
out by a nearby bakery, and catch birds and

00:01:59.009 --> 00:02:01.950
rats that were slow enough for him to grab.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:07.539
Even as a young boy, he was enormous, three
times the size of other boys his age.

00:02:07.539 --> 00:02:11.959
His strength and stature made him appealing
to the workhouses at first, but they always

00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:16.379
ended up throwing him out, calling him a monster,
le monstre.

00:02:16.379 --> 00:02:20.470
After the third workhouse chased him into
the streets with whips, he resigned himself

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:25.500
to a solitary life in the shadows, down the
abandoned alleyways where not even the beggars

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.760
would go, so overrun were they were rats and
filth.

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:34.550
It was better for Fernand that way, no one
would try to mock him, to hurt him, to dispose

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.510
of the monster once and for all.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:41.830
He spent his days and nights there, in the
little alleyway he had turned into a home,

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:45.970
keeping as quiet as possible out of fear that
he would be discovered by someone with ill

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.300
intentions.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:51.800
One night, he got his hands on a row of meat
tarts left on a windowsill and ate to his

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.170
heart's content.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:58.170
He slept unusually soundly that night, with
a full belly for the first time in a long

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:02.420
time, and without knowing it, he must have
begun to snore.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.170
As the first soft beams of sunlight fell across
his face, stirring him from sleep, he heard

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:09.230
the sound of a strange man's voice.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.690
Perhaps it was someone just passing by on
a nearby street?

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:17.530
But no, there was a shadow at the end of the
alleyway, blocking out some of the light.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:22.489
He retreated out of sight, hoping to avoid
detection, but he could see two more blurry

00:03:22.489 --> 00:03:24.860
figures stepping into his vision.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:28.310
All of a sudden, they started running toward
him at top speed.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:34.250
This was no accidental encounter, they had
spotted him and were targeting him specifically.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.250
For what?

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.810
He didn't want to find out.

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:41.310
The giant boy climbed to his feet and tried
to run, but the alley was narrow, and the

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:45.620
three men grabbed hold of each of his arms,
while one grabbed his legs and forced him

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:46.910
to the ground.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:51.050
Someone stuffed a dirty rag into his mouth,
muffling his cries for help, and out of the

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:55.540
corner of his eye, he saw the glint of a metal
pipe swinging at his head.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.189
Then, everything went dark.

00:03:57.189 --> 00:04:02.629
When Fernand opened his eyes again, all he
could see at first was red, vivid red on all

00:04:02.629 --> 00:04:03.629
sides.

00:04:03.629 --> 00:04:06.740
As his vision adjusted, he realized he could
see metal bars as well.

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:12.220
The red was fabric, bright cloth draped over
the iron cage that now held him prisoner.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:17.560
He stumbled to his feet, forced to stoop to
avoid bumping his head on the top of the cage,

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.100
and rattled the bars desperately.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.100
"Let me out!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.100
Please!"

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:24.160
He begged, though he felt as though it was
useless.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:28.780
His plea was not met with silence, however,
but with loud, cheerful music.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:34.081
He covered his ears at the sudden noise, jumping
back, but it came from all sides, and there

00:04:34.081 --> 00:04:35.380
was no escape.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:39.890
Suddenly, his eyes were blinded by a sudden
bright light as the red cloth was yanked from

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.250
the cage in one swoop.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:46.470
It took a moment for his eyes to adjust, but
as he blinked the tears from his eyes, Fernand

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:52.400
could make out a man with a large mustache,
a long red and gold coat, a matching top hat,

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.660
and a gold-tipped cane.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:58.350
The man grinned at him, but it was not a friendly
face.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:03.320
The smile did not reach his eyes, which glinted
with a cold, cruel delight.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:08.640
Behind the ringmaster, Fernand could now see
a crowd sitting: men, women, and children

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:14.949
all watching him with rapturous fascination,
a mix of intrigue, disgust, and horror on

00:05:14.949 --> 00:05:16.000
their faces.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:22.539
He looked from face to face, seeking any kindness,
any sympathy, but found not one who looked

00:05:22.539 --> 00:05:24.830
as if they might help him escape.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:29.560
The music climbed to a crescendo, and when
it stopped, the ringmaster spoke.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:34.820
"Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls, today
I have brought you something the likes of

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:37.880
which no one has ever seen before!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:43.319
I have traveled the world in search of oddities
and curiosities to delight and shock you with,

00:05:43.319 --> 00:05:48.860
and after crossing every ocean, exploring
the furthest reaches of the globe, I have

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.190
brought you a very special gift!

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:54.169
Do not be afraid, the beast will not harm
you!

00:05:54.169 --> 00:05:57.860
I will ensure that you are all perfectly safe.

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:02.449
Should he try anything at all, one of my helpers
here," he gestured to one of two large men

00:06:02.449 --> 00:06:07.789
standing on either side of the cage, each
brandishing an ax, "Will simply strike him

00:06:07.789 --> 00:06:09.009
with their axes!"

00:06:09.009 --> 00:06:14.420
Fernand recoiled at the threat, but there
was nowhere for him to go in the cramped cage,

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.099
already a bit too small for his massive body.

00:06:17.099 --> 00:06:22.000
The ringmaster continued his speech, pacing
back and forth in front of the cage and running

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.470
his cane across the bars with a horrible clattering
sound.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:31.161
"As you can see, this creature looks like
a boy, but his statue reveals the truth: it

00:06:31.161 --> 00:06:34.210
is something else entirely!

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:38.539
Something bigger, stronger, more vicious than
any child could ever be!

00:06:38.539 --> 00:06:43.550
You see the legs like great tree trunks, the
arms strong enough to wrestle a bear!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:48.170
But do not, dear audience, neglect to notice
its mighty jaws!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:54.090
Like steel, strong enough to crush anything
it bites down on, strong enough to crack through

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.090
bone!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:07:00.020
And the teeth...enormous and pearly white,
with a smile bright enough to light up the

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.120
darkness.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:04.840
What do you say, beast, will you give the
people a smile?"

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:09.319
Fernand cowered in the cage, watching everything
with wide, frightened eyes.

00:07:09.319 --> 00:07:11.759
He certainly did not feel like smiling.

00:07:11.759 --> 00:07:16.169
When he did not budge, the ringmaster thwacked
his cane against the bars, making another

00:07:16.169 --> 00:07:18.419
horrible metallic clang.

00:07:18.419 --> 00:07:19.419
"Well?

00:07:19.419 --> 00:07:23.350
These people paid good money to be here, do
not keep them waiting!"

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:27.570
After another moment of silence and Fernand
remaining stock still, the audience began

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:31.910
to boo, tossing empty popcorn bags and insults
at the cage.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:37.259
The ringmaster leaned in close and whispered,
"Smile for the people, or I'll see to it you

00:07:37.259 --> 00:07:40.050
suffer agony you could only dream of."

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:44.449
This threat snapped Fernand out of his frozen
terror, and, standing as tall as he could

00:07:44.449 --> 00:07:50.379
in the little cage, he smiled wide, showing
all of his many, many teeth at once.

00:07:50.379 --> 00:07:55.630
The audience erupted into cheers at the sight,
and the band played triumphant horns as the

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.280
ringmaster basked in the applause.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.530
"How about that?"

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:03.419
The ringmaster took off his hat and bowed
low to the ground, holding out the hat for

00:08:03.419 --> 00:08:08.789
the audience to toss in coins in a token of
their appreciation for an excellent show.

00:08:08.789 --> 00:08:13.289
By the time the applause was finished, his
hat was filled with shiny silver and gold.

00:08:13.289 --> 00:08:18.349
He tossed the hat, now heavy with new wealth,
to one of the guards, and pulled a gold-handled

00:08:18.349 --> 00:08:19.390
whip from his pocket.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.350
"Ah, but I haven't finished yet!"

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:25.960
He cracked the whip ominously, then turned
toward the cage.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:29.009
He cracked the whip again, this time across
Fernand's back.

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:33.990
The boy roared in pain, a great bellowing
sound that carried for miles around, and fell

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.320
to his knees.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:40.260
The sound was so loud, so powerful, that the
audience was terrified.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:45.110
Small children began to cry, and people poured
from the circus tent in a panic, afraid the

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.300
beast would break free and tear them apart.

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:52.880
But there was no beast, only a frightened
boy who did not understand his own strength,

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:57.140
crying at the cruelty the world had shown
him all his life.

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:01.589
Once they were alone, the ringmaster turned
to Fernand again, catching his eye.

00:09:01.589 --> 00:09:04.070
"Stop your crying, boy.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:06.149
From here on out, you will be coming with
me.

00:09:06.149 --> 00:09:09.519
Together, we're going to be very, very rich.

00:09:09.519 --> 00:09:12.510
And I will make you a star.

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.950
Whether you want to be one or not."

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.520
And for a time, that became Fernand's life.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:22.640
Night after night, crammed into a cage, fed
on chicken bones and leftover scraps, paraded

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:28.060
in front of uncaring audiences as the ringmaster
tormented him, showed him off as a sideshow

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:32.660
attraction, and forced him to smile with the
threat of the ax or the whip.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:36.350
His fellow circus folk were not much kinder
than the ringmaster, either.

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:39.920
The clowns sprayed him with water and taunted
him through the bars.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:44.620
The animal trainers threatened to pit him
against their lions and see who came out alive.

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:50.260
Only one person ever showed Fernand an ounce
of kindness at the circus, a bearded lady

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.190
who would sing opera songs in a beautiful,
clear soprano.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:59.149
Her voice was the loveliest thing Fernand
had ever heard, a tiny slice of heaven in

00:09:59.149 --> 00:10:01.710
the hell his life had become.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:06.890
Days bled together as the tour went on, a
stretch of seemingly endless days and nights,

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.839
until the day of the last show came.

00:10:09.839 --> 00:10:14.050
He looked up at the thin slivers of night
sky visible through the gaps in the tent,

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.820
the twinkling of stars just out of reach.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.360
What would become of him after the tour ended?

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.950
What horrors awaited him next?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:25.540
Would he just sit there and take it, or would
he finally do something to bring it all to

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.540
a close?

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:31.660
He flexed his muscles quietly, taking notice
of how he had grown over the past few months.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:36.300
Regular feedings, more than he had gotten
on the street, had bulked him up considerably.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:41.930
He now stood at over seven feet tall, and
could feel that his strength had doubled,

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.320
or even tripled.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:47.880
The show began as it usually did, with the
crack of the ringmaster's whip.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:52.209
But suddenly, the man stepped forward and
began a speech he had never made before.

00:10:52.209 --> 00:10:55.959
"As you can see, this great beast cowers at
the sound of my whip!

00:10:55.959 --> 00:11:01.560
Over the months, I have trained it, domesticated
it until it was aggressive no longer!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:04.019
Behold, as I set it free!"

00:11:04.019 --> 00:11:09.390
And, to Fernand's shock, the ringmaster unlocked
the door to the cage and swung it open.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:14.450
He took a tentative step out, standing at
his full height for the first time in months

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.529
as he stretched his spine straight.

00:11:16.529 --> 00:11:18.579
"See how it is tamed!

00:11:18.579 --> 00:11:20.210
Go on now, boy!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.210
Smile for your public!

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.450
They've been so good to us."

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:28.050
He jabbed Fernand's ribs with his cane, hard
enough to leave a dark purple bruise.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:30.010
"You heard me, smile!"

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:34.779
The whip cracked again, and the audience began
to boo and jeer, throwing their garbage at

00:11:34.779 --> 00:11:35.779
Fernand.

00:11:35.779 --> 00:11:40.610
A bag hit his cheek with a slap, and a deep,
dark, rage finally awoke beneath the months

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:41.610
of terror.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:46.420
"You remember our agreement, do as I say,
or I shall cut off something you’ll miss!"

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:51.050
Before the ringmaster could say another word,
Fernand grabbed him and pulled him into a

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.060
bone-crushing embrace.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:58.630
The man's voice came out in a squeak, "Beast,
what are you doing?"

00:11:58.630 --> 00:11:59.630
"That!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.630
Is!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.630
Not!

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:02.630
My name!"

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:07.610
Fernand bellowed, and he opened his mouth
wide, wider than he ever had before, and gobbled

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:10.610
up the ringmaster in three quick bites.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:15.310
The audience screamed, fleeing from their
seats, but Fernand moved faster than they

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:16.310
did.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:20.560
He grabbed person after person, starting with
those that had been the cruelest and shouted

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:25.480
the most insulting things, and devoured them
one by one.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:31.020
When he was full, he ran into the night, into
the forest, and did not stop until he was

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.020
free.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:36.190
He bathed in the river, washing away all that
he had done, and remained there for quite

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:40.389
some time, feeding on passersby when his hunger
got the better of him.

00:12:40.389 --> 00:12:45.230
His sense of time grew fuzzy then, and he
could not be sure how long he spent there.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:50.680
But word of missing townspeople eventually
reached a special organization, one dedicated

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:56.230
to studying those like him, and for the second
time in his life, Fernand was taken into custody

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.640
by strangers.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:02.910
However, these scientists were much kinder
to him, and never called him a beast.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:06.420
They simply gave him a number, SCP-082.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.699
Want to own an SCP of your own?

00:13:09.699 --> 00:13:13.610
Go to scpswag.com for premium anomalous merchandise!

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:20.640
Now go and check out “SCP-082 - Fernand
the Cannibal” and “SCP-001 - Can SCP-049

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.110
Finally Cure When Day Breaks?”

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:25.300
for more bizarre and disturbing Fernand antics!

